{"product_id":"horrid-henry-and-the-zombie-vampire","title":"Horrid Henry and the Zombie Vampire","description":"\u003cp\u003eProduct description      Four new stories in which Horrid Henry terrorizes his classmates at a school sleepover in the museum; plays with Perfect Peter and tricks him into handing over all his money; gets out of writing his own story for Miss Battle-Axe by adapting one of Peter's; and meets the Nudie Foodie, a celebrity chef, who comes to the school to improve school dinners. No more burgers! No more chips!      About the Author      Francesca Simon spent her childhood on the beach in California, and then went to Yale and Oxford Universities to study medieval history and literature. She now lives in London with her English husband and their son. When she is not writing books she is doing theatre and restaurant reviews or chasing after her Tibetan Spaniel, Shanti.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 132 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Francesca Simon\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781842551356\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 96\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45743090106521,"sku":"16RB-1-9781842551356","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68d2b8deb328b_Horrid_Henry_and_the_Zombie_Vampire_Francesca_Simon.jpg?v=1758708976","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/horrid-henry-and-the-zombie-vampire","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}